announcement-shuttle-called-title = Emergency Shuttle Dispatched

announcement-shuttle-called-intro = The emergency shuttle has been called.

announcement-shuttle-called-red = Red Alert state confirmed: Dispatching priority shuttle.

announcement-shuttle-called-eta = It will arrive in { $minutes } { $minutes ->
    [one] minute
   *[other] minutes
 }.

announcement-shuttle-called-traced = Call signal traced. Results can be viewed on any communications console.

announcement-shuttle-called-norecall = Warning: Shuttle recall subroutines disabled; Recall not possible.

announcement-shuttle-recalled-title = Emergency Shuttle Recalled

announcement-shuttle-recalled-text = The emergency shuttle has been recalled.

announcement-shuttle-recalled-traced = Recall signal traced. Results can be viewed on any communications console.

announcement-shuttle-docked-title = Emergency Shuttle Arrival

announcement-shuttle-docked-text = { $shuttle } has docked with the station. You have { $time } to board the emergency shuttle.

announcement-shuttle-departure-title = Emergency Shuttle Departure

announcement-shuttle-departure-text = The emergency shuttle has left the station. Estimate { $minutes } minutes until the shuttle docks at { $destination }.

announcement-shuttle-transit-title = Emergency Shuttle Transit Failure

announcement-shuttle-transit-text = The emergency shuttle is preparing for direct jump. Estimate { $minutes } minutes until the shuttle docks at { $destination }.

announcement-system-error-title = SYSTEM ERROR:

announcement-shuttle-corruption-text = Corruption detected in shuttle navigation protocols. Please contact your supervisor.

announcement-shuttle-status-title = Emergency Shuttle Status

announcement-shuttle-auth-needed-text = { $remaining } { $remaining ->
    [one] authorization
   *[other] authorizations
 } needed until shuttle is launched early.

announcement-shuttle-auth-revoked-text = Early launch authorization revoked, { $remaining } { $remaining ->
    [one] authorization
   *[other] authorizations
 } needed.

announcement-shuttle-launch-countdown-text = The emergency shuttle will launch in { $time } seconds

announcement-sender-emergency-shuttle = Emergency Shuttle

announcement-blackhole-title = The Orion Trail

announcement-blackhole-text = Sensors indicate that a black hole's gravitational field is affecting the region of space we are heading through.

announcement-interns-text = We're sending you our bravest interns, please let them in when they arrive.

announcement-turbulence-text = Please note, we are entering an area of subspace turbulence. For your own safety, please fasten your belts and remain seated until the vehicle comes to a complete stop.

announcement-starfury-text = Unidentified armed ship detected near the station.

announcement-sender-spacecraft-engineering = { $sender } Spacecraft Engineering

announcement-catastrophe-cause-1 = was attacked by { $syndicate } Operatives

announcement-catastrophe-cause-2 = mysteriously teleported away

announcement-catastrophe-cause-3 = had its refuelling crew mutiny

announcement-catastrophe-cause-4 = was found with its engines stolen

announcement-catastrophe-cause-5 = [REDACTED]

announcement-catastrophe-cause-6 = flew into the sunset, and melted

announcement-catastrophe-cause-7 = learned something from a very wise cow, and left on its own

announcement-catastrophe-cause-8 = had cloning devices on it

announcement-catastrophe-cause-9 = had its shuttle inspector put the shuttle in reverse instead of park, causing the shuttle to crash into the hangar

announcement-catastrophe-intro = Your emergency shuttle { $cause }.

announcement-catastrophe-insured = Luckily, your shuttle insurance has covered the costs of repair!

announcement-catastrophe-bonus = You have been awarded a bonus from { $sender } for smart spending.

announcement-catastrophe-replacement = Your replacement shuttle will be the { $shuttle } until further notice.

announcement-insurance-incoming-title = Incoming Message

announcement-insurance-incoming-text = Incoming subspace communication. Secure channel opened at all communication consoles.

announcement-insurance-late-text = You are definitely too late to purchase insurance, my friends. Our agents don't work on site.

announcement-insurance-scam-text = You didn't send us enough money for shuttle insurance. This, in the space layman's terms, is considered scamming. We're keeping your money, scammers!

announcement-insurance-thanks-text = Thank you for purchasing shuttle insurance!

announcement-loan-prefix = Cargo: { $text }

announcement-loan-commandeered-title = Cargo shuttle commandeered by { $sender }.

announcement-loan-default-sender = Centcom

announcement-loan-default-text = Unset announcement text

announcement-loan-default-thanks = The cargo shuttle should return in five minutes. Have some supply points for your trouble.

announcement-loan-thanks-five = The cargo shuttle should return in five minutes.

announcement-loan-antidote-sender = CentCom Research Initiatives

announcement-loan-antidote-text = Your station has been chosen for an epidemiological research project. Send us your cargo shuttle to receive your research samples.

announcement-loan-department-resupply-sender = CentCom Supply Department

announcement-loan-department-resupply-text = Seems we've ordered doubles of our department resupply packages this month. Can we send them to you?

announcement-loan-syndiehijacking-sender = CentCom Counterintelligence

announcement-loan-syndiehijacking-text = The syndicate are trying to infiltrate your station. If you let them hijack your cargo shuttle, you'll save us a headache.

announcement-loan-bees-sender = CentCom Janitorial Division

announcement-loan-bees-text = One of our freighters carrying a bee shipment has been attacked by eco-terrorists. Can you clean up the mess for us?

announcement-loan-bomb-sender = CentCom Security Division

announcement-loan-bomb-text = We have discovered an active Syndicate bomb near our VIP shuttle's fuel lines. If you feel up to the task, we will pay you for defusing it.

announcement-loan-bomb-thanks = Live explosive ordnance incoming via supply shuttle. Evacuating cargo bay is recommended.

announcement-loan-papers-please-sender = CentCom Paperwork Division

announcement-loan-papers-please-text = A neighboring station needs some help handling some paperwork. Could you help process it for us?

announcement-loan-papers-please-thanks = The cargo shuttle should return in five minutes. Payment will be rendered when the paperwork is processed and returned.

announcement-loan-pizza-delivery-sender = CentCom Spacepizza Division

announcement-loan-pizza-delivery-text = It looks like a neighbouring station accidentally delivered their pizza to you instead.

announcement-loan-russian-party-sender = CentCom Russian Outreach Program

announcement-loan-russian-party-text = A group of angry Russians want to have a party. Can you send them your cargo shuttle then make them disappear?

announcement-loan-spider-gift-sender = CentCom Diplomatic Corps

announcement-loan-spider-gift-text = The Spider Clan has sent us a mysterious gift. Can we ship it to you to see what's inside?

announcement-loan-mail-strike-sender = Spinward Mail Workers Union

announcement-loan-mail-strike-text = The Mail Workers Union wants to borrow your cargo shuttle to employ "advanced union strike tactics" with. Payment is strictly in mails.
